2026-11-14 Pattern Studio redistribution of the existing training conversion.
Modified files are the seven model/configuration files listed in inference.json.
The original checkpoint was converted to Diffusers component files, FP16 model
weights and safetensors serialization. The text encoder retains 23 transformer
blocks, as required by the existing LeftRefill training and inference route.
No model parameters were further changed while packaging this release.
The source checkpoint conversion was performed previously. The exact original
download and conversion command have not been independently reconstructed here.

